<title>FRANCE: Cegetel partners sign final pact.</title>
<headline>Cegetel partners sign final pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux said on Wednesday that it has signed the final agreements with its partners in the Cegetel telecommunications group which aims to be the main rival to France Telecom.</p>
<p>In a statement, Generale des Eaux said that as planned it would take a 44 percent stake, British Telecommunications Plc 26 percent, Mannesmann 15 percent and SBC also 15 percent.</p>
<p>Generale des Eaux added that implementation of the agreements had already started and that the regulatory approval procedures would soon begin.</p>
</text>
